Overlay patch 0013: bump LUS's iOS-fetched spdlog to v1.15.3.
Same new-toolchain breakage as overlay 0001 (Torch): the fmt bundled with
spdlog v1.14.1 fails under this Mac's clang ("call to consteval function ...
is not a constant expression", logger.h:334 via stox.cpp). Only
cmake/dependencies/ios.cmake FetchContents spdlog (macOS uses brew's 1.15.x
via find_package), so the oracle is unaffected. Pin by commit like 0001.

--- a/libultraship/cmake/dependencies/ios.cmake
+++ b/libultraship/cmake/dependencies/ios.cmake
@@ -43,7 +43,7 @@
     FetchContent_Declare(
         spdlog
         GIT_REPOSITORY https://github.com/gabime/spdlog.git
-        GIT_TAG v1.14.1
+        GIT_TAG 6fa36017cfd5731d617e1a934f0e5ea9c4445b13 # v1.15.3: v1.14.1's bundled fmt breaks under clang 17 consteval
         OVERRIDE_FIND_PACKAGE
     )
     FetchContent_MakeAvailable(spdlog)
